{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_01",
  "title": "特里蒙街道",
  "storyCode": "DV-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "abbcc0c3e6a607fc5ff8e36c05ffe742b5553be6e02a483ae208ab3846cb1205",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "......难以置信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "我明明已经启动了信号干扰，就连可露希尔研发的最新一代无人机都不该侦测到我们的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "这动力甲用的是什么传感技术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "能瘫痪它吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "我本来不想引人注目......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "博士，抓紧些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "百分之十功率，瞄准——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "命中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "侦测到右侧臂甲出现明显破损。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "没有减速。在命中的那一刻，它也毫无停顿的迹象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "动力甲里面是什么人？他难道不会觉得痛吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "左侧上臂破损。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "右侧小腿破损。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "博士，它没有对损伤作出任何反应。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "想让它停下来，除非我能一击瘫痪它的动力核心——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "可这完全说不通啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "就算是最训练有素的士兵，也不可能有这样的忍耐力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "你说得没错。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "只要是活着的个体，几乎都做不到完全控制自己最基础的神经反应。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一只手击碎了动力甲的中心。无数机械碎片与火花一起喷溅而出，就如同属于另一种生命形式的血液。\n那只手很快就收了回去。\n被她的力道带出来的机甲残片，与覆在她五指上的纯白硬甲一同化作了粉尘，飘洒着落下，在地面上结成薄薄一层钙质结晶。\n动力甲躺在地上，它的能源之火已经熄灭，躯干正中留下了一个边缘齐整的空洞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "......徒手击穿了动力甲的核心？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "很强的威力，而且确实比我的防御炮动静小得多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "博士，看来我们不必担心被当成爆破犯，被那个什么源石制品管理局带走了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也不希望罗德岛多出新的案底。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我一点都不想念哥伦比亚的拘留室。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "谢谢你，塞雷娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "不必谢我，博士，还有Mechanist先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "是我将罗德岛卷入莱茵内部的事务中——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "我有义务确保你们不受到任何伤害。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "......斐尔迪南猜对了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "罗德岛的人已经见到了塞雷娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "要继续追吗，女士？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "假如我把你塞进刚才的动力甲里，你觉得自己能活下来吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "不必如此紧张。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "只是一个假设。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "女士，那个塞雷娅再怎么厉害，他们也就只有三个人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "我们有这么多人，还有秘密武器......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "永远不要低估任何人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "和莱茵生命打了这么久的交道，你还没学会吗？看起来越文弱的科学家，说不定揍起人来越狠。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "您、您是说那个机械师，还有另一个看不见脸的学者吗？他们难道比莱茵防卫科主任还厉害？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "罗德岛......人才济济啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "走吧。我很喜欢刚才的假设，也有几个想尝试一下的新主意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "晚上好，上校先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "上校的声音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "......克鲁尼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "上校的声音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "解释一下基地的事情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "只是一些小打小闹而已......您很清楚，无论我们给的条件多么优厚，拓荒者们都很难感到满足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "进取心是他们的优点，是哥伦比亚不断发展的根基，但偶尔也会造成一些......麻烦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "上校的声音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "既然是麻烦，那么，解决它。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "上校的声音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "我要看到的是你承诺的成果，而不是一则提到莱茵生命的社会新闻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "上校的声音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "要知道，哥伦比亚的科技公司可不止你们一家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "......明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "请您放心，上校。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "莱茵生命的产品一定不会让您失望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，有好几个人不想干了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "他们说你的法子没有用，不会有人理睬我们。我们的声音从来传不出去，尝试再多办法都是白搭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "他们还说，别管莱茵生命想做什么了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我们就该赶紧干完这份活，领到钱，去下一个地方接着干。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那几个......失踪的人，就是他们的命不好。反正那些深入荒野的拓荒队伍里，每年死的人比我们这多多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......别说了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "告诉其他人，再等一等。我会把我们的同伴带回来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那你有什么打算？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我出去一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "你要出去？那......那岂不是很危险？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "要是警方派出了狙击手，他们会不会就在等你出去......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......那样正好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "正、正好？你该不会是紧张到大脑错乱了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "警队的人是吧？也许是我的老熟人。她用弩射得很准，非要走到最后一步的话，我大概不会太痛苦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "桑尼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "乌比卡博士，摩尔医生——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我需要你们跟我一起到外面走一趟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "何必这么惺惺作态。我们有说不的权利吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "抱歉，请再忍耐一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "等亲眼看到你们的处境，外面的人或许就会改主意，愿意更认真地考虑我们的请求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "警长，有人出来了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "无人机射击准备——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "不，先停下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "......警长？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "我们不能伤到人质。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "那个......赫默医生，过来一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "女士，是有什么新情况吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "你拿着望远镜看一眼，跟在桑......拓荒者身后的人，是不是你的那两位同事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，通、通讯器亮了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......拿过来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "果然是你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "这句话该换我来说。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你现在是......警长了吧？我还没有机会说一声恭喜。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "没想到，你会自愿在这个辖区待这么久......拓荒区的麻烦事一直都这么多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我也没想到......你会堕落成这样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你还记得你上过的那些课吗？那些跟法律相关的课程？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你还记得......我成为警察的那一天，你都跟我说了些什么吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "“太好了，我们又是搭档了，就跟我们小时候玩的游戏那样，我们会一起维护哥伦比亚的秩序，将所有罪恶绳之以法——”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "哈......多么讽刺啊，眼下那个最该被绳之以法的罪犯就是你自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "玛丽......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你的队员手里拿的是什么东西？自制武器？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "快把那丢人的玩意儿放下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你把自己作践成了这副模样，但你还有选择。最后的选择。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "放了你身边那两位无辜的女士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......不，暂时还不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "该死，你正在一步步走向悬崖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "在哥伦比亚，一名罪犯不想待在监狱里的话，还能加入拓荒队。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "但如果......在拓荒区，他再次违法，他会面临什么指控？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "回答我，律师先生！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "别那么叫我，求你了，玛丽......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你在逼我后悔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "是的，我开始后悔......在你闯进我家里的那天，我竟然原谅了你，而不是立刻把你抓进警局。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "那都是过去的事了，那时候我刚刚......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......我很抱歉，我一直很抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "但是，这一回我做这些是有原因的，请你一定要听我说......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "......领队！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "怎么了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那个医生、医生她......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......摩尔医生？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "配置......发生错误......修改......电源计划模式......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "糟了，乔伊丝......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "乌比卡博士，她怎么了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......你可以理解成，她的病发作了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "什么？！矿、矿石病吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "快，我扶住她了！她身上有没有药？我......我不会注射......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "唔......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "她看起来真的很难受！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我......我这有莱茵生命配发的紧急医疗环，你们不是说这对矿石病病情有用吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我这就给她戴上......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你竟然愿意把自己的紧急医疗装置让给乔伊丝？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "把这个环给她的话，万一你也突然病发，你的生存几率会大幅度降低。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "医生一直对我们很好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我一点都不想让她出事......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "明明绑架我和乔伊丝的人也是你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我们并不想忘恩负义。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "对不起......我们只是一群自私的普通人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......通讯是不是还在继续？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "女士，我想请您准许我与拓荒者们通话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "那位病发的黎博利是我的同事，也是我的好友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "更重要的是，我是她的医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我想向拓荒者们了解一下她的情况。从他们的反应来看，他们对她并非漠不关心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......随便你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "但你没有太多时间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "我刚收到上头的指示，要是拓荒者们再不合作，我们会在十分钟后切断整个实验基地的通讯......以及拓荒者生活区的供电。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "切、切断供电？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "荒地上昼夜温差非常大......等到了半夜，他们会冻得受不了的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "还有，拓荒者里有不少矿石病晚期患者......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "他们需要医疗设备维系生命！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......我知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "所以这才称得上警告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "他们得看到莱茵生命和警方的决心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "所有抗争和诉求都必须建立在合法的基础上......一旦走上了犯罪道路，就没有人会听他们解释。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "可是......您和那位拓荒者领队不是朋友吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......朋友？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "从他自甘堕落的那一刻起，我们之间就再无话可说。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "她怎么样了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "实时血液结晶密度下来了，眼动指数还是很不正常。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "眼动指数？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "因为她的矿石病病灶就在脑部。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "任何病情波动都会影响她的神经系统，令她陷入深度睡眠，甚至可能诱发癫痫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "呃？谁在说话？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......通讯器还开着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你好，领队先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我是乔伊丝·摩尔的医生，我叫赫默。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......赫默医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "首先，我想对你表示感谢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "有了你和其他拓荒者的帮助，乔伊丝的状态才能这么快稳定下来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "您竟然会对绑架犯说谢谢......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "作为回报，也请你相信我，我们真的很想帮助你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "还有五分钟，通讯和你们所在生活区的供电就会被同时切断——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "领队，突、突然断电了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "看来他们提前行动了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "没关系。我还是该谢谢您愿意提醒我们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我从玛丽女士那里听说了，你们想和莱茵生命的高层对话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我能问问是什么原因吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我想请他们停下这个基地正在进行的实验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......停止实验？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "您和摩尔医生一样，也是位好心的医生。但要停止这么大的工程，您恐怕做不了主。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "您能不能转告莱茵生命的老总，这个实验真的很危险？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "桑尼先生，你有没有证据？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "就算我有，您又愿意相信我......相信一名无路可走的拓荒者吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "警长，我们准备好了，随时可以切断基地通讯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......等赫默医生说完她想说的话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "可是主任要求通讯必须立刻......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "我是警长，还是你们莱茵生命的主任是警长？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "告诉那个斐尔迪南，怎么救人是我的事，还轮不到他指手画脚！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "主任已与您的局长打过招呼了，警长。这是他们一起制订的计划。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "主任......斐尔迪南？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我没想到，现在的防卫科也归能量科管了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "要是斐尔迪南觉得结构科也是他说了算的话，我不介意立即从莱茵生命辞职。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "乔伊丝......乔伊丝！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "她......睡着了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "她彻底失去了意识。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "如果不能得到及时治疗的话，她......用不了多久就会脑死亡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "桑尼先生，我准备立刻进入基地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我理解你的担忧，所以你放心，我不会携带任何武器。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
          "text": "医生，你别做傻事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "不，我很清醒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "桑尼先生，我也不会让任何警察......或者防卫科的人跟着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
          "text": "赫默研究员，我会把你的行动汇报给主任......帕尔维斯主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我将以罗德岛干员的身份进入359号基地——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
          "text": "还有我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "——我的电气工程师同事会与我同行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我们会为基地的矿石病患者提供无偿的医疗服务。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "不止是为了我的朋友，也为你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我不管莱茵生命会做出什么选择。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我只知道，救治感染者是罗德岛一贯的行为准则。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
